{"1-6":{"people":[{"id":"jehoshaphat-h3092i","name":"Jehoshaphat","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":3,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":2,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":3,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"asa-h0609g","name":"Asa","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"ephraim-h0669g","name":"Ephraim","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Joseph","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"david-h1732","name":"David","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":3}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H3092","lemma":"יְהוֹשָׁפָט","tr":"ye·ho·sha·phat","gloss":"Jehoshaphat","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":84},{"base":"H3063","lemma":"יְהוּדָה","tr":"ye·hu·dah","gloss":"Judah","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":820},{"base":"H1875","lemma":"דָּרַשׁ","tr":"da·rash","gloss":"to seek","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":164},{"base":"H1870","lemma":"דֶּ֫רֶךְ","tr":"de·rekh","gloss":"way: conduct","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":706},{"base":"H5333","lemma":"נְצִיב","tr":"ne·tsiv","gloss":"garrison","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":11},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":1090},{"base":"H1361","lemma":"גָּבַהּ","tr":"ga·vah","gloss":"to exult","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":34},{"base":"H1219","lemma":"בָּצַר","tr":"ba·tsar","gloss":"to gather","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":37},{"base":"H6239","lemma":"עֹ֫שֶׁר","tr":"o·sher","gloss":"riches","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":37},{"base":"H0842","lemma":"אֲשֵׁרָה","tr":"a·she·rah","gloss":"Asherah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":40}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2CH","chapter":18,"verse":1,"verseEnd":1,"votes":9,"source":"both","text":"Now Jehoshaphat had an abundance of riches and honor, and he allied himself with Ahab by marriage.","from":5},{"book":"2KI","chapter":22,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"And he did what was right in the eyes of the LORD and walked in all the ways of his father David; he did not turn aside to the right or to the left.","from":3},{"book":"ISA","chapter":41,"verse":10,"verseEnd":10,"votes":7,"source":"both","text":"Do not fear, for I am with you; do not be afraid, for I am your God. I will strengthen you; I will surely help you; I will uphold you with My righteous right hand.","from":3},{"book":"1KI","chapter":12,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"After seeking advice, the king made two golden calves and said to the people, “Going up to Jerusalem is too much for you. Here, O Israel, are your gods, who brought you up out of the land of Egypt.”","from":4},{"book":"MAT","chapter":6,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"But seek first the kingdom of God and His righteousness, and all these things will be added unto you.","from":5},{"book":"1SA","chapter":10,"verse":27,"verseEnd":27,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"But some worthless men said, “How can this man save us?” So they despised him and brought him no gifts; but Saul remained silent about it.","from":5},{"book":"2CH","chapter":15,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"When Asa heard these words and the prophecy of Azariah son of Oded the prophet, he took courage and removed the detestable idols from the whole land of Judah and Benjamin and from the cities he had captured in the hill country of Ephraim. He then restored the altar of the LORD that was in front of the portico of the LORDʼs temple.","from":2},{"book":"2CH","chapter":32,"verse":23,"verseEnd":23,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Many brought offerings to Jerusalem for the LORD and valuable gifts for Hezekiah king of Judah, and from then on he was exalted in the eyes of all nations.","from":5}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2},{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"7-13":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":5,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"ben-hail-h1134","name":"Ben-hail","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"micaiah-h4322g","name":"Micaiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"nethanel-h5417l","name":"Nethanel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"obadiah-h5662n","name":"Obadiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"zechariah-h2148h","name":"Zechariah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"adonijah-h0138h","name":"Adonijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"asahel-h6214h","name":"Asahel","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"elishama-h0476k","name":"Elishama","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"jehonathan-h3083l","name":"Jehonathan","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"jehoram-h3088h","name":"Jehoram","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"nethaniah-h5418i","name":"Nethaniah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"shemaiah-h8098j","name":"Shemaiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"shemiramoth-h8070h","name":"Shemiramoth","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"tobadonijah-h2899","name":"Tobadonijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"tobijah-h2900g","name":"Tobijah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"zebadiah-h2069l","name":"Zebadiah","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":8},{"id":"jehoshaphat-h3092i","name":"Jehoshaphat","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":3,"firstVerse":10}],"places":[{"id":"arabia-h6152b","name":"Arabia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"philistia-h6429","name":"Philistia","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"jerusalem-h3389","name":"Jerusalem","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":13}],"words":[{"base":"H3063","lemma":"יְהוּדָה","tr":"ye·hu·dah","gloss":"Judah","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":820},{"base":"H1134","lemma":"בֶּן־חַ֫יִל","tr":"ben-cha·yil","gloss":"Ben-hail","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H2899","lemma":"טוֹב אֲדֹנִיָּה","tr":"tov a·do·niy·yah","gloss":"Tobadonijah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":2},{"base":"H7651","lemma":"שֶׁ֫בַע","tr":"she·va","gloss":"seven","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":394},{"base":"H3092","lemma":"יְהוֹשָׁפָט","tr":"ye·ho·sha·phat","gloss":"Jehoshaphat","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":84},{"base":"H3925","lemma":"לָמַד","tr":"la·mad","gloss":"to learn: teach","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":86},{"base":"H5973","lemma":"עִם","tr":"im","gloss":"with","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":1051},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":4,"uses":1090},{"base":"H3881","lemma":"לֵוִי","tr":"le·viy·yi","gloss":"Levi","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":291},{"base":"H1003","lemma":"בִּירָנִית","tr":"bi·ra·nit","gloss":"fortress","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"2CH","chapter":14,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"and attacked all the cities around Gerar, because the terror of the LORD had fallen upon them. They plundered all the cities, since there was much plunder there.","from":10},{"book":"2CH","chapter":26,"verse":8,"verseEnd":8,"votes":6,"source":"both","text":"The Ammonites brought tribute to Uzziah, and his fame spread as far as the border of Egypt, for he had become exceedingly powerful.","from":11},{"book":"EXO","chapter":15,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"The nations will hear and tremble; anguish will grip the dwellers of Philistia.","from":10},{"book":"EXO","chapter":15,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"openbible","text":"and terror and dread will fall on them. By the power of Your arm they will be as still as a stone until Your people pass by, O LORD, until the people You have bought pass by.","from":10},{"book":"EXO","chapter":34,"verse":24,"verseEnd":24,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"For I will drive out the nations before you and enlarge your borders, and no one will covet your land when you go up three times a year to appear before the LORD your God.","from":10},{"book":"2CH","chapter":9,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"not including the revenue from the merchants and traders. And all the Arabian kings and governors of the land also brought gold and silver to Solomon.","from":11},{"book":"2CH","chapter":16,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"For the eyes of the LORD roam to and fro over all the earth, to show Himself strong on behalf of those whose hearts are fully devoted to Him. You have acted foolishly in this matter. From now on, therefore, you will be at war.”","from":10},{"book":"2CH","chapter":35,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"To the Levites who taught all Israel and were holy to the LORD, Josiah said: “Put the holy ark in the temple built by Solomon son of David king of Israel. It is not to be carried around on your shoulders. Now serve the LORD your God and His people Israel.","from":7}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]},"14-19":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"adnah-h5734h","name":"Adnah","kind":"person","brief":"Army commander","count":1,"firstVerse":14},{"id":"jehohanan-h3076j","name":"Jehohanan","kind":"person","brief":"Jehoshaphat's commander","count":1,"firstVerse":15},{"id":"amasiah-h6007","name":"Amasiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Zichri","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"zichri-h2147n","name":"Zichri","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Amasiah","count":1,"firstVerse":16},{"id":"benjamin-h1144g","name":"Benjamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"eliada-h0450i","name":"Eliada","kind":"person","brief":"Benjamite commander","count":1,"firstVerse":17},{"id":"jehozabad-h3075i","name":"Jehozabad","kind":"person","brief":"Jehoshaphat's commander","count":1,"firstVerse":18}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H0505","lemma":"אֶ֫לֶף","tr":"e·leph","gloss":"thousand","lang":"h","inPassage":6,"uses":506},{"base":"H3967","lemma":"מֵאָה","tr":"me·ah","gloss":"hundred","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":581},{"base":"H5973","lemma":"עִם","tr":"im","gloss":"with","lang":"h","inPassage":5,"uses":1051},{"base":"H1368","lemma":"גִּבּוֹר","tr":"gib·bor","gloss":"mighty man","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":159},{"base":"H2428","lemma":"חַ֫יִל","tr":"cha·yil","gloss":"strength: soldiers","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":246},{"base":"H8269","lemma":"שַׂר","tr":"sar","gloss":"ruler","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":421},{"base":"H8084","lemma":"שְׁמֹנִים","tr":"she·mo·nim","gloss":"eighty","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":38},{"base":"H5734","lemma":"עַדְנָה","tr":"ad·nah","gloss":"Adnah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H0450","lemma":"אֶלְיָדָע","tr":"el·ya·da","gloss":"Eliada","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4},{"base":"H3075","lemma":"יְהוֹזָבָד","tr":"ye·ho·za·vad","gloss":"Jehozabad","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":4}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"JDG","chapter":5,"verse":9,"verseEnd":9,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"My heart is with the princes of Israel, with the volunteers among the people. Bless the LORD!","from":16},{"book":"GEN","chapter":12,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"I will make you into a great nation, and I will bless you; I will make your name great, so that you will be a blessing.","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":13,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"I will make your offspring like the dust of the earth, so that if one could count the dust of the earth, then your offspring could be counted.","from":14},{"book":"GEN","chapter":15,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"And the Lordtook him outside and said, “Now look to the heavens and count the stars, if you are able.” Then He told him, “So shall your offspring be.”","from":14},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“Take a census of the whole congregation of Israel by their clans and families, listing every man by name, one by one.","from":14},{"book":"NUM","chapter":1,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"and on the first day of the second month they assembled the whole congregation and recorded their ancestry by clans and families, counting one by one the names of those twenty years of age or older,","from":14},{"book":"JDG","chapter":5,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"“When the princes take the lead in Israel, when the people volunteer, bless the LORD.","from":16},{"book":"2SA","chapter":1,"verse":21,"verseEnd":22,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"O mountains of Gilboa, may you have no dew or rain, no fields yielding offerings of grain. For there the shield of the mighty was defiled, the shield of Saul, no longer anointed with oil. From the blood of the slain, from the fat of the mighty, the bow of Jonathan did not retreat, and the sword of Saul did not return empty.","from":17}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":2}]}}